  <h2>What it pays</h2>
  <p>The money is <strong>marked bills</strong>, so you need a fence before you can spend it. We don't have our own payout yet: on our first pull we got the cassettes out but were wasted before we could carry the bills away. Other guides report:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>About <strong>$720 per bundle</strong> of marked bills, with a best run of <strong>$7,200</strong> from one ATM (GTA6Motors).</li>
    <li>Another <strong>$7,200</strong> ATM on the HUD, lost to a dye pack (reported by GTA6 Japan).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Set the ATM row in our <a href="/gta-6/make-money/">money per hour calculator</a> to your own runs. It starts at a cautious $4,000 until we've cashed one out ourselves.</p>

  <h2>The three-ATM tip</h2>
  <p>In the story, a contact offers you <strong>"three ATMs, 24-hour windows on each"</strong> for free, to prove what good timing is worth before you decide to invest with them. Each tipped ATM stays full for a day, so you don't have to rush, but don't sit on it either. We got the tip in Chapter 3. One guide puts ATM jobs after Yasmani's Chapter 3 jewelry jobs, and another says you can start in Chapter 2, so it may vary.</p>

  <h2>Tips from our attempts</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Pick a quiet spot to break it open.</strong> We dragged ours into the street and the cops were on us while we were still at the cassettes.</li>
    <li><strong>Mind the blast.</strong> Explosives get the cassettes out fast, but stand well clear and have your escape car ready.</li>
    <li><strong>Bank your clean cash first.</strong> Dying on a job can cost what's in your pocket, so deposit at a regular ATM before you go.</li>
    <li><strong>Watch for dye packs.</strong> One guide says Fleeca ATMs can be booby-trapped. It's not clear yet whether the Dye Pack Jammer helps here.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>More ways to make money</h2>
  <p>ATMs are a side hustle next to the bigger jobs. See our <a href="/gta-6/smash-and-grab/">smash and grab guide</a> for jewelry stores and pawn shops, the <a href="/gta-6/heists/">heists page</a> for bank robberies we've done, and the <a href="/gta-6/make-money/">money guide</a> to compare money per hour.</p>
